  "id": "depakote",
  "term": "Depakote",
  "definition": "Depakote is a form of divalproex sodium, a compound made from sodium valproate and valproic acid that has anticonvulsant and antiepileptic effects. In the digestive tract it separates into valproate, which may raise brain levels of GABA and reduce repetitive nerve firing by affecting sodium channels.",
